			"url": "https://github.com/casey/just/discussions/2934",
			"summary": "The opener asks whether just could emit telemetry such as traces per invocation and spans per recipe to tools like Sentry or OpenTelemetry, so teams can see which workflows matter, and invites opinions.",
			"actorId": "MDQ6VXNlcjY0MjA5OTE=",
			"actorType": "human"
		},
		{
			"id": "DC_kwDOA6gfW84A4kvV",
			"kind": "comment",
			"actor": "casey",
			"createdAt": "2025-10-30T19:21:01Z",
			"url": "https://github.com/casey/just/discussions/2934#discussioncomment-14830549",
			"summary": "The maintainer doubts telemetry can be added in a privacy-respecting way, says it would need per-user opt-in, and floats opt-in logging that users could upload themselves.",
			"actorId": "MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDU=",
			"actorType": "human",
			"parentId": "D_kwDOA6gfW84AirPE"
		},
