			"url": "https://github.com/casey/just/discussions/2934#discussioncomment-14924495",
			"summary": "The opener says per-recipe instrumentation works but is noisy and laborious, since just is a natural chokepoint, and accepts the privacy concern outweighs the benefit if few users want it.",
